     A* * * CLIENT SUMMARY WORK FILE  - SELECTIONS FROM SEARCH * * *
     A*
     A                                      REF(CSREFP)
     A          R PCL01                     TEXT('CLIENT SUMMARY WORK FILE')
     A            CLCLT#    R               REFFLD(CLT#)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLIENT' 'NUMBER')
     A            CLMTF     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('M/T/F' 'SEARCH' 'FLAG')
     A            CLSS#     R               REFFLD(SS#)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYEE' 'SOC' 'SEC#')
     A            CLFRST    R               REFFLD(NM7)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYEE' ' FIRST' 'NAME')
     A            CLMI      R               REFFLD(NM1)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYEE' 'MIDDLE' 'INTIAL')
     A            CLLAST    R               REFFLD(NM10)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYEE' 'LAST' 'NAME')
     A            CLITMS    R               REFFLD(ITMS)
     A                                      COLHDG('NUMBER' 'OF ITEMS')
     A            CLXREF    R               REFFLD(XREF)
     A                                      COLHDG('DETAIL' 'XREF#')
     A                                      TEXT('DETAIL XREF#, SEE CWCSP')
     A******
     A            CLSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            CLUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('RECORD' 'MAINTAINED BY')
     A            CLPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PGM' 'MAINTAINED' 'IN')
     A            CLTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            CLDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            CLIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('RECORD' 'CREATED BY')
     A            CLIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'CREATED')
     A*
